{"Title":"An Act clarifying the rights of employees in education collaboratives","BillNumber":"H449","DocketNumber":"HD528","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JSC1","Name":"Josh S. Cutler","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JSC1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-06T12:57:02.053"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JSC1","Name":"Josh S. Cutler","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JSC1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-06T12:57:02.0533333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H449/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Cutler of Pembroke, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 449) of Josh S. Cutler relative to the rights of employees in education collaboratives.  Education.","DocumentText":"\tSection 4E of chapter 40 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2014 Official Edition, is hereby amended by adding the following sentence after the first sentence in the ninth paragraph:-\r\n\tThe provisions of sections forty-one, forty-two, forty-two D and forty-three of chapter 71 shall apply to each category of employees named in those sections who serve in education collaboratives.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J14","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J14"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}